## ```
weave capitalize with s as string into string:
    return calling s.get_capitalize
## Functional form of `title`: every word capitalized.
##
## ## Parámetros
## - `s`: the string to title-case.
##
## ## Retorno
## A new owned string; the original spacing is preserved.
##
## ## Ejemplo
## ```pengu
