weave title with s as string into string:
    return calling s.get_title
## @deprecated Use title instead.
##
## ## Parámetros
## - `s`: the string to title-case.
##
## ## Retorno
## Same as `title`; kept only for compatibility.
##
## ## Ejemplo
## ```pengu
